  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/DSC_0002.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 319px\" /></p>\n<p>Versiones de canciones de los 70 y alguna de los 60, a cargo del grupo local Coronel,&nbsp;han inundado de m&uacute;sica la noche de este jueves el Ateneo Cultural y Mercantil de Onda, dentro de su programaci&oacute;n semanal para noviembre y diciembre.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcoronelateneu051213/dsc_0002.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcoronelateneu051213/dsc_0003.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcoronelateneu051213/dsc_0007.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0007\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcoronelateneu051213/dsc_0008.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0008\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcoronelateneu051213/dsc_0009.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0009\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcoronelateneu051213/dsc_0010.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0010\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcoronelateneu051213/dsc_0011.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0011\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcoronelateneu051213/dsc_0013.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0013\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcoronelateneu051213/dsc_0014.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0014\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4